      "diff": "@@ -25,7 +25,11 @@ If you or your organization would like to contribute or become a sponsor, please\n \n The following changes have been made since version 4.7.1:\n \n-* Follow Stream is implemented for HTTP/3. wsbuglink:20610[].\n+* HTTP/3 improvements:\n+  Reassembly is implemented.\n+  Decompression is implemented for gzip/deflate, brotli, and zstd.\n+  Media type dissectors are called for the Content-Type.\n+  Follow Stream is implemented. wsbuglink:20610[].\n \n The following changes have been made since version 4.7.0:\n \n",
